OpenCPN 5.14.2 for AmigaOS 3: the style graphics and the settings file.
- styles.cpp: the tool icon sheets were looked for at "uidata//x.png"; the
  folder already ends in '/', and "//" is the parent folder on AmigaDOS, so
  no style loaded. The separator is added only when it is missing.
- base_platform.cpp: opencpn.conf goes in User/ with the rest of the
  settings (it went to ENVARC:.OpenCPN, wx's user data folder).

